[Unit]
Description=Lian Li wireless RGB init trigger (intentionally NOT enabled at boot: lianli-fan-speed.service and lianli-wireless-rgb.service each already re-trigger lianli-rgb-init.service after their own daemon restart, so an independent boot-time fire here only adds RF/socket contention. Still startable on demand.)

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=2s

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
